  // pushing lines. It can only ever ADD protection (referencedPids/referencedDirs/kept),
  // exactly like every other non-actionable status already does. The one cost, accepted
  // deliberately: a genuinely stale marker-sourced session (e.g. a real `SUTRADHAR_CLI_STATE_DIR`
  // session whose Chrome exited without a clean `close`) no longer self-cleans via this path —
